    "plan": {
      "format": "python_code_unconstrained",
      "content": "class EnsureAirConditionerOn(py_trees.behaviour.Behaviour):\n    def __init__(self, name, state_url, action_url):\n        super().__init__(name)\n        self.state_url = state_url\n        self.action_url = action_url\n\n    def update(self):\n        # Check current state\n        resp = http_client.get(self.state_url)\n        if resp.status_code == 200 and resp.json() == \"on\":\n            return Status.SUCCESS  # Already on\n\n        # Turn it on\n        resp = http_client.post(self.action_url)\n        return Status.SUCCESS if resp.status_code == 200 else Status.FAILURE\n\nclass SetFanSpeed(py_trees.behaviour.Behaviour):\n    def __init__(self, name, action_url, fan_speed):\n        super().__init__(name)\n        self.action_url = action_url\n        self.fan_speed = fan_speed\n\n    def update(self):\n        try:\n            response = http_client.post(self.action_url, json={\"fan_speed\": self.fan_speed})\n            if response.status_code == 200:\n                return Status.SUCCESS\n            return Status.FAILURE\n        except Exception:\n            return Status.FAILURE\n\n# Define the behavior tree\nensure_ac_on = EnsureAirConditionerOn(\n    name=\"Ensure AC On\",\n    state_url=\"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/home96/guest_bedroom/artifacts/guestBedroomAirConditioner/properties/state\",\n    action_url=\"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/home96/guest_bedroom/artifacts/guestBedroomAirConditioner/turn_on\"\n)\n\nset_fan_speed_high = SetFanSpeed(\n    name=\"Set Fan Speed High\",\n    action_url=\"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/home96/guest_bedroom/artifacts/guestBedroomAirConditioner/set_fan_speed\",\n    fan_speed=\"high\"\n)\n\n# Create a sequence to ensure the AC is on before setting the fan speed\nsequence = py_trees.composites.Sequence(name=\"Set AC Fan Speed to High\", memory=True, children=[\n    ensure_ac_on,\n    set_fan_speed_high\n])\n\ntree = sequence",
      "explanation": "The behavior tree is designed to set the air conditioner's fan speed to 'high' in the guest bedroom. It consists of two custom behaviors:\n\n1. **EnsureAirConditionerOn**: This behavior checks if the air conditioner is already on. If it is not, it sends a command to turn it on. It uses the air conditioner's state property to determine if it is on and the `turnOn` action to turn it on if necessary.\n\n2. **SetFanSpeed**: This behavior sets the fan speed to 'high'. It sends a POST request to the `setFanSpeed` action with the parameter `fan_speed` set to 'high'.\n\nThese behaviors are combined in a sequence with memory, ensuring that the air conditioner is turned on before attempting to set the fan speed. The sequence will only proceed to set the fan speed if the air conditioner is successfully turned on.",
